OL,3,AJade Thirlwall says working on Blue
OL,4,APlanet III song was magical
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger Jade Thirlwall says working on
OL,7,Fthe official song for BBC documentary
OL,8,FBlue Planet III is "one of the best
OL,9,Fthings" she's ever done.
OL,11,FThe former Little Mix star worked with
OL,12,Flegendary composer Hans Zimmer on Into
OL,13,FThe Deep (Seas Cry), a piece created
OL,14,Ffor the launch of the series narrated
OL,15,Fby Sir David Attenborough.
OL,17,FThirlwall, who debuted the track on BBC
OL,18,FRadio 1's Breakfast Show, told host
OL,19,FGreg James working on it was a "very
OL,20,Fspecial" experience.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
